/vis/open
/vis/viewer/set/autoRefresh false
/vis/verbose errors

/vis/drawVolume
/vis/viewer/set/style surface
/vis/viewer/set/viewpointThetaPhi 120 150
/vis/scene/add/axes

#### Might need this, not sure 
#####/tracking/storeTrajectory 1

/vis/scene/add/trajectories smooth
/vis/modeling/trajectories/create/drawByCharge

/vis/viewer/set/autoRefresh true
/vis/verbose warnings

###Note: we turn autoRefresh off for setting everything up because if we didn't then after every change the scene would reset
####turn it back on later because now we do want to see updates after every change. 

/run/beamOn 10